does wearing boots of speed effectively halve the rate at which monsters
are generated? i found boots of speed early in a nh3.0h6 game and noticed
that the monsters are few and far between once you've cleared the level
while wearing the boots. perhaps this is more of a problem when it is coupled
with the fact that monsters are leaving corpses less frequently in pl6 and
that when you find a corpse the chances of it giving an intrinsic attribute
have been decreased. also, food is no problem, i'm not getting hungry so
the food generation rate seems okay.

is halving the monster generation rate a fair compensation for wearing
speed boots?
